        "text_preview": "\n2 the Act referred to in rule 3.1.1. (5) herein or the rules or regulations in respect of which the offence is alleged to have been committed, the Adjudicating Authority shall,in the first instance, issue a notice to such person or persons"
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "a853099a1bb040918fac8324576331ca_41",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "STA"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "Sub-rule (9) of rule 3.1.1 provides that the Adjudicating Officer shall given an opportunity to such person or persons to produce such documents or evidence as he may consider relevant to the inquiry and if necessary, the hearing may be adj"
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "ac68b6e097044c5caa2b63b7ba1e183f_42",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "Therefore,\nunder this provision, the person who is being prosecuted u/s.\n68 of the Act of 2006, an statutory right has been given to produce the document as he considers it relevant to the inquiry."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "0c0436dd525d4cea8e5cefb3dd1690aa_43",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "The petitioner in order to provide his innocence filed an application for summoning the expert whose report is being relied upon by the Food Safety Officer against him."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "84848a6ef1184c0d93fe968c67ee0a5a_44",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "The Adjudicating Authority has not assigned any reason while rejecting the said application."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "be305051742e412896852109749bfa4b_45",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "The Appellate Tribunal has remanded the matter for fresh adjudication after giving an opportunity of hearing."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "9e48aea56d6e483d9bfcc6312362eb5c_46",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "Learned Adjudicating Authority has failed to exercise the jurisdiction vested on him.\"\n7."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "bd9ef84f2b724527ba56d58571f608ac_47",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "In the present case also it is evident that the petitioner in order to prove his innocence filed an application for summoning the expert whose report is being relied upon by the Food Safety Officer against him."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "68f348c282da4bcfb9715c1bc3bcd3b2_48",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "RATIO"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "The adjudicating authority ought to have allowed the application preferred by the petitioner and should have summoned the expert whose report is being relied upon by the Food Safety Officer."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "d376789651604c94b307f7e98a709346_49",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "RATIO"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
